---
---

<footer class="footer-bg" style="padding:3rem 0 2rem;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <a href="/brainmind-homepage/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
          <img src="/brainmind-homepage/logo.png" alt="로고" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl object-contain">
          <span style="font-size:.97rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--text);">뇌와 마음사이</span>
        </a>
        <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.7;max-width:210px;word-break:keep-all;">
          인지신경과학 기반 — 뇌과학과 심리학을 하나의 언어로 묶는 채널
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:.85rem;">콘텐츠</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <a href="/brainmind-homepage/blog/" class="footer-link">블로그</a>
          <a href="/brainmind-homepage/research/" class="footer-link">연구</a>
          <a href="/brainmind-homepage/videos/" class="footer-link">영상</a>
          <a href="/brainmind-homepage/dashboard/" class="footer-link">대시보드</a>
          <a href="/brainmind-homepage/about/" class="footer-link">소개</a>
          <a href="https://youtube.com/@뇌와마음사이" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link">YouTube</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:.85rem;">연결</p>
        <div class="flex gap-2.5 mb-4">
          <a href="https://youtube.com/@뇌와마음사이" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-social">
            <iconify-icon icon="solar:youtube-linear" style="font-size:1rem;"></iconify-icon>
          </a>
          <span class="footer-social footer-social-disabled" aria-label="Instagram 준비 중" role="img">
            <iconify-icon icon="solar:instagram-linear" style="font-size:1rem;"></iconify-icon>
          </span>
          <span class="footer-social footer-social-disabled" aria-label="뉴스레터 준비 중" role="img">
            <iconify-icon icon="solar:letter-linear" style="font-size:1rem;"></iconify-icon>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.65;word-break:keep-all;">
          모든 콘텐츠는 피어리뷰 논문 기반.<br>참고 문헌은 각 영상 설명란에서.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--divider);padding-top:1.4rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
      <p style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-muted);">© 2026 뇌와 마음사이 · Between Brain and Mind</p>
      <p style="font-size:.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);word-break:keep-all;font-style:italic;">"뇌를 알면 조금은 덜 휘둘리게 됩니다."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
